# Raspberry Pi Digital Signage Kiosk
#
# Example crontab entries for display power scheduling.
#
# Open the user's crontab with:
#
# crontab -e
#
# Replace YOUR_USERNAME with the Raspberry Pi kiosk username.

# Turn the display on every day at 7:00 AM.
0 7 * * * /home/YOUR_USERNAME/screen_on.sh

# Turn the display off every day at 10:00 PM.
0 22 * * * /home/YOUR_USERNAME/screen_off.sh
